  "needs_confirmation": [
    "Hostel room fees are not on the fee circular (they come from the admissions handbook); confirm the 2027-28 hostel fees.",
    "Other fee (₹15,000): the circular lists it among annual components; the calculator charges it in Semester 1 of every year (schedule.other_fee_every_year).",
    "Specialisation fee (₹30,000 a year from Year 2): the circular does not name the programmes; the calculator applies it only to B.Tech CSE when a specialisation is chosen (schedule.specialization_fee_programs).",
    "Bus, hostel and special concessions: the circular gives annual amounts but no payment schedule; the calculator places them in Semester 1 of each year (schedule.*_semester).",
    "Scholarship continuation in later years is assumed (schedule.scholarship_continues_every_year); the circular does not state renewal conditions.",
    "JEE Main: 30% is printed as 90–94.5 percentile and 40% as 95+; a percentile between 94.5 and 95 is not covered and is flagged for verification.",
    "IB: the circular's IB ranges overlap (30–33 under 25%, 30–37 under 30%, 35/45+ under 40%); the lower figure is applied and the Admissions Office confirms IB scores 30 to 37.",
    "Minimum marks: 55% for B.Tech CSE and ECE (and their specialisations), 50% for other UG programmes. B.Tech AI & Robotics and B.Tech IEP are listed separately from CSE/ECE, so 50% is applied; confirm.",
    "PG minimum (50% in the qualifying degree) is subject to confirmation.",
